(7430456, 1173335, 98565, '<td valign="top">Clean and great reflection - this should do well<br/>I visited this mosque last year ans was overwhelmed by its splendor. It''s not easy to photograph though because the extreme light conditions and the large amount of visitors. You managed this really well!</td>', 'Clean and great reflection - this should do wellI visited this mosque last year ans was overwhelmed by its splendor. It''s not easy to photograph though because the extreme light conditions and the large amount of visitors. You managed this really well!', '2016-01-21 01:00:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(7430457, 1172182, 98565, '<td valign="top">I''ll eat my hat if this handsome model isn''t Cy and the special postprocessing that brings out every lovely details isn''t Sue''s...<br/>Well done! Makes me want to reach out and touch his hair</td>', 'I''ll eat my hat if this handsome model isn''t Cy and the special postprocessing that brings out every lovely details isn''t Sue''s...Well done! Makes me want to reach out and touch his hair', '2016-01-21 01:07:51.000000', NULL, 1),
