(7430459, 1172675, 98565, '<td valign="top">perfectly contrasted from the background, well done. I wonder if it would be even better if the whole tail was visible</td>', 'perfectly contrasted from the background, well done. I wonder if it would be even better if the whole tail was visible', '2016-01-21 01:13:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(7430463, 1173996, 98565, '<td valign="top">This was at a performance, right? The possibilities to actually frame this shot were limited so you did quite a nice job on the given circumstances ( I tried to shoot at a dancing performance myself and know how hard it is)<br/>Nevertheless I want to tell you why I rated this only 5:<br/>I don''t like her hand cropped off, the spare room above her head is missing at the bottom. The light on her face is not ideal since it is mainly on the turned away side. The cut between blue and black background is running right through the second girls head - would have been nice to have a consistent bg. But I like the determined expression which you picked up nicely in your title</td>', 'This was at a performance, right? The possibilities to actually frame this shot were limited so you did quite a nice job on the given circumstances ( I tried to shoot at a dancing performance myself and know how hard it is)Nevertheless I want to tell you why I rated this only 5:I don''t like her hand cropped off, the spare room above her head is missing at the bottom. The light on her face is not ideal since it is mainly on the turned away side. The cut between blue and black background is running right through the second girls head - would have been nice to have a consistent bg. But I like the determined expression which you picked up nicely in your title', '2016-01-21 01:33:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(7430465, 1163723, 98565, '<td valign="top">Haha, these kids are great models! Unfortunately this shot is missing adequate light, seems a bit dull and too yellowish to me. And the ornament on the tiles draws too much attention on it</td>', 'Haha, these kids are great models! Unfortunately this shot is missing adequate light, seems a bit dull and too yellowish to me. And the ornament on the tiles draws too much attention on it', '2016-01-21 01:44:28.000000', NULL, 1),
