(7431002, 1172959, 141542, '<td valign="top">I''ve been such an absentee.  I''ve committed myself to being back behind the camera this year, but never did I imagine the way I''d start this year would be with this photo, in this place, among peers who can really judge a picture for its merits.<br/> <br/>I sincerely appreciate your feedback, and your votes.  This really means a great deal, especially among the competition that I faced.  Thank you.</td>', 'I''ve been such an absentee.  I''ve committed myself to being back behind the camera this year, but never did I imagine the way I''d start this year would be with this photo, in this place, among peers who can really judge a picture for its merits. I sincerely appreciate your feedback, and your votes.  This really means a great deal, especially among the competition that I faced.  Thank you.', '2016-01-22 07:43:35.000000', NULL, 0),
