(7431471, 1171731, 114285, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by mariuca:</b></div><hr/><i> <table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by Neat:</b></div><hr/><i> Seriously tell us the story behind this photo did you have to wait there for someone to walk by or was it  a mere candid? </i></td></tr></table> <br/>Seriously Anita, what are the odds in NYC to wait for an old woman carrying two huge bags? It was a candid. <br/>Actually, I waited for two seconds to take out the cover of the lens.<br/>Thank you all for the comments. I did have two or three outtakes but this was too much of a happy coincidence not to post it </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>Thanks, I''ve  never noticed them before but I trust they are everywhere.</td>', 'Originally posted by mariuca: Originally posted by Neat: Seriously tell us the story behind this photo did you have to wait there for someone to walk by or was it  a mere candid?  Seriously Anita, what are the odds in NYC to wait for an old woman carrying two huge bags? It was a candid. Actually, I waited for two seconds to take out the cover of the lens.Thank you all for the comments. I did have two or three outtakes but this was too much of a happy coincidence not to post it   Thanks, I''ve  never noticed them before but I trust they are everywhere.', '2016-01-24 09:21:57.000000', NULL, 0),
