(7432533, 1164195, 87808, '<td valign="top">Compared to the first place entry.  THIS should have been 1st. An absolutely stunning photo, action, clarity, drama, depth.  No idea how this was not 1st.  In my book, a total Blue!  Well done, fantastic image.</td>', 'Compared to the first place entry.  THIS should have been 1st. An absolutely stunning photo, action, clarity, drama, depth.  No idea how this was not 1st.  In my book, a total Blue!  Well done, fantastic image.', '2016-01-28 00:29:34.000000', NULL, 0),
